sequenceDiagram
    participant Agent as AI workload
    participant SPIRE as SPIRE Workload API
    participant Auth as Token service
    participant A as MCP server A
    participant B as MCP server B
    Agent->>SPIRE: Request workload identity
    SPIRE-->>Agent: JWT-SVID for token service
    Agent->>Auth: Exchange SVID for resource A + scopes
    Auth->>Auth: Verify identity and policy
    Auth-->>Agent: Access token, 5-minute lifetime, audience A
    Agent->>A: Call tool with token
    A->>A: Check signature, audience, expiry and scope
    A-->>Agent: Allowed result or denial
    Agent->>B: Present the same token
    B-->>Agent: Reject wrong audience
